# Frontier Dog: collars. Every dog of Arthur's wears one - its own, or the first in this list; the stable hand changes
# it for another. Shipped data: an update replaces this file.
# A collar is a part of a game dog's outfit (a metaped asset) put on any dog with _SET_META_PED_TAG:
# collar.<id>=drawable,albedo,normal,material,palette,tint0,tint1,tint2 (read in game with the 'comps' and 'tagcopy'
# test hooks; the palette is a hash or a metaped_tint_* name, tints 0-254, colour survey with 'collartint'); its name is
# collar.<id> in Lang.*.dat.
#
# studded: the bloodhound's studded leather collar (a_c_doghound_01 presets 3, 5, 6, 7 - the only collar the game
# draws as a part of its own; the foxhound's is painted into its coat)
collars=studded
collar.studded=0x401AFD6D,0x2878FA0B,0xDC62DC1C,0xB0582D1F,0,0,0,0
